Z||000000||Philphine||10-29-2001||10:27 AM||||<BR>ok. i'm a 41 year old male and somewhat mature but that being said: i'm in bed and a big spider just crawled across my covers. i didn't want to smash it on my covers so i was trying to knock it off my bed but i missed and now it's somewhere around. even better, i saw a little one while i was fighting (for my life i tell you) with the big one. it's time to get up.<P>STOP LAUGHING. IT'S NOT FUNNY!!!||||reg||1
