Z||000003||Formula88||10-29-2001||11:21 AM||||Reminds me of the time I saw a big, hairy spider at my friends old farmhouse.  I whacked it with a magazine.  Did you know that mother spiders carry their young on their back?  Neither did I, but I found out, when what I thought was one big spider suddenly exploded into one big spider and MILLIONS (it seemed) itty bitty spiders!!!  Can you say = YIKES!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.theunholytrinity.org/cracks_smileys/contrib/ruinkai/spidereekA.gif"> ||||reg||9
